48 well plate with a lid -- 48 well plate is modelled as 48 separate hollow cylinders with air in between them
5mm of media in each well
Source modelled as described in Maryam's paper: 1.2um thick layer of Sr sandwiched between two 50um layers of silver, further sandwiched between two 50um layers of steel, with a radius 4.1mm(!!)
Doses are scored in a 50um layer at the bottom of each well; each well is also divided into 50um x 50um voxels
5e8 events (runtime 75 min on 24 threads)
Cutoff distance 5um
This folder contains 3 runs corresponding to 3 different source positions (moving the source in an L shape)
These simulations are now deprecated -- I have now updated the well plate dimensions. Old dimensions can be seen in git history prior to 11/11/26